<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH APRIL REAL PPI +0.3 PCT MO/MO, +4.3PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>CZECH APRIL REAL PPI +0.3 PCT MO/MO, +4.3PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech real industrial producer prices were 0.3 percent higher in May, putting prices 4.3 percent higher than in the same month in 1996, the Czech Statistical Bureau (CSU) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The CSU added that May real construction prices, based on estimates, rose 1.0 percent, month-on-month, putting the year-on-year rate at 11.1 percent.</p>
</text>
